usage: j3c -e <tool> ...  (or --editor)
  scene|render|gen|mcp|android|script-props   scene editor tools and the MCP server (`j3c -e scene --help`)
  imgdiff a.png b.png [--tol N] [--max N] [--out d.png]   pixel diff for goldens
  web serve|run DIR [--headless] [--frames N] [--screenshot F]   serve or run a built web folder
--- stderr
--- exit 0
